==Description==
'''The Star''' is one of the curses that appears in the [[Null & Void Event]]. It can be voted for by the players every few waves. If voted for, it will boost enemy stats and rewards.

==Effects==
When applied, all towers will receive a 5% [[Range Debuff]] and 5% [[Firerate Debuff]] (~5.26% increase). To compensate the total placement limit will be increased for all players by 5. While the description says it is increased by 10, this is not correct.

==Trivia==
*'''The Star''' is based on the [[wp:The Star (tarot card)|The Star]] tarot card.

